    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/47145c560b2cfbae3059ccb55c621903.avif?t=1754411161\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new arrival to the island, you're here to meet eligible <strong>bachelorx pads</strong> and find the love of your life! Enjoy a one-of-a-kind story as you navigate a bizarre dating adventure amongst a unique set of structures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover hidden secrets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of biomes across an island, jam-packed with goodies! Search through a somber forest, climb up a snowy mountain, or just lay in a flowery field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic building movement!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw away your dreams of home ownership! Instead, become the house! Embrace the freeing sensation of flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go on a date!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking to shack up? Choose between Millie (a windmill who might step on you if you ask nicely) or Tenet (who's just a himbo tent). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or go fishing instead?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say there\u2019s plenty of fish in the sea\u2026 but you won\u2019t find any around here. We replaced all the fish with cars because it just made more sense.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And much more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist the game and join our discord to stay up-to-date! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/bc4a96cfb017e6ae3441941fb58b74f3.avif?t=1754411161\" width=460 height=214 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/47145c560b2cfbae3059ccb55c621903.avif?t=1754411161\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new arrival to the island, you're here to meet eligible <strong>bachelorx pads</strong> and find the love of your life! Enjoy a one-of-a-kind story as you navigate a bizarre dating adventure amongst a unique set of structures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover hidden secrets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of biomes across an island, jam-packed with goodies! Search through a somber forest, climb up a snowy mountain, or just lay in a flowery field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic building movement!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw away your dreams of home ownership! Instead, become the house! Embrace the freeing sensation of flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go on a date!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking to shack up? Choose between Millie (a windmill who might step on you if you ask nicely) or Tenet (who's just a himbo tent). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or go fishing instead?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say there\u2019s plenty of fish in the sea\u2026 but you won\u2019t find any around here. We replaced all the fish with cars because it just made more sense.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.poster.avif?t=1754411161\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.webm?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.mp4?t=1754411161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And much more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist the game and join our discord to stay up-to-date! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/bc4a96cfb017e6ae3441941fb58b74f3.avif?t=1754411161\" width=460 height=214 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Experience life as a house in this silly adventure game! Play as a building as you roll, jump, and wave-dash across a cozy island. Meet eligible structures, romance them, and experience a bizarre, yet oddly familiar story.. or go fishing instead (though we replaced fish with cars to make more sense)",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe whole vibe here is 'charmingly awkward,' and Building Relationships seems like it's managed to avoid feeling like it's simply weird for weirdness's sake.\u201d<br>GamesRadar+<br><br>\u201cAt the heart of it all, the dialogue in Building Relationships is gearing up to be quite special, mimicking online conventions with tons of personality.\u201d<br>Paste Magazine<br><br>\u201cThe headline was intriguing, but made no sense. So I clicked on it and underneath was an article that was intriguing and also made no sense.\u201d<br>from the comment section of a Guardian article<br>",
